 "note": "Identified by the printed title 'THOMAS C. PASSIOS ELEMENTARY SCHOOL FACULTY' (line 1), Principal Cyndy Daukantas. CAUTION, TWO SCHOOLS ON ONE PAGE: the left column is headed 'THOMAS C. PASSIOS SCHOOL' (line 4; grades 1A-4E, TLC, tutors, reading, Title I, day care, guidance) and the right column carries its own heading 'PRIMARY SCHOOL' (line 6; preschool, kindergarten K-1..K-6, teaching assistants, special ed, a second nurse, speech) -- those right-column entries on lines 7-25 carry grade_or_dept 'PRIMARY SCHOOL'. The schema has one school per page, so `school` is passios by the title; the right column's Specialists (28-39), Cafeteria (41-44) and Custodians (45-47) are not assignable to either building from the page (one custodian is printed '(Primary)'). Left-column labels such as 'Tutors', 'Title I Tutors', 'Day Care' are kept as role_raw on the line they are printed; continuation names below them have role_raw empty. Line 4 holds the left heading and nurse Rebecca Lantry (right, before the PRIMARY SCHOOL heading, grade_or_dept empty). Line 53 right: Annette Queen with no printed label (below Custodians), grade_or_dept empty. Line 27 holds 'Specialists:' heading beside Larry Bennett (entry line); line 54 page number ignored."
